      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "乔布斯：\n「本质上，这让我们在真正开拍前\n就能对电影做 beta 测试和迭代」",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "乔布斯：\n「本质上，这让我们在真正开拍前\n就能对电影做 beta 测试和迭代」",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 58
    },
